  <iati-identifier>XM-DAC-41123-PROJECT-230141</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-41123" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations Industrial Development Organization</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening statistical data for industrial policy in Saudi Arabia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims at supporting the institutional capacity of the National Industrial and Mining Information Center (NIIC) of the Ministry of Industry and Mining (MIM) in Saudi Arabia, in collecting and analysing statistical information for informing policy decisions in a timely and sustainable manner. This in light of the enhanced data needs to support the implementation of the National Industrial Strategy (NIS). This is a re-activation of project SAP ID 170003, whose activities could not be completed due to the restrictions imposed during the COVID-19 pandemic and institutional changes at both the MIM and UNIDO.</narrative>
  </description>
